.\n\nSkin texture rendered ultra-hyperrealistically: visible micro-texture across cheeks and décolletage, fine pores concentrated on T-zone (nose bridge) showing minute imperfections without being distracting, faint sebum glow along jawline suggesting healthy hydration under bright lighting.\n\nHair color: deep glossy black roots transitioning into warm chestnut highlights near ends; hairstyle: sleek center-parted long straight hair cascading down shoulders with few loose strands framing face naturally, no obvious styling product residue or frizzing effect seen upon close inspection.\n\nOutfit details: off-shoulder fuzzy cropped bodice made from plush faux fur fabric exhibiting individual fiber tufts and uneven edge fringe; matching high-waisted shorts crafted similarly but cut shorter than hip level revealing thigh contours cleanly; garment edges show deliberate shedding of fibers adding tactile realism.\n\nSetting context: minimalist professional photography studio environment featuring seamless charcoal gray wall behind subject as background element only; floor appears neutral beige carpeting providing grounding contrast against monochrome setting; spatial composition feels intimate due to tight frame focus around torso area excluding full-body shot perspective.\n\nLighting setup: controlled three-point studio illumination using diffused key light positioned slightly above camera axis casting gentle rim highlight along shoulder line while fill lights soften shadows beneath chin creating dimensional modeling; overall ambient tone maintains consistent brightness avoiding harsh glare points despite reflective surfaces present within clothing material.\n\nColor grading scheme: dominant cool-toned palette dominated by crisp whites contrasting starkly against muted indigo-black backgrounds; desaturated pastel-inspired hues applied selectively over facial features emphasizing luminosity rather than vibrancy—low saturation approach aligning with modern cinematic aesthetics.\n\nNegative prompt keywords strictly excluded include: blurry outlines, cartoonish distortion, anime-style rendering, exaggerated proportions, plastic-like artificiality, oversharpened pixels, motion blur artifacts, non-existent anatomy structures like extra limbs or malformed joints, low-resolution textures such as pixelation noise, unnatural skin tones including overly pink/red undertones unless artistically intentional, unrealistic eye reflections mismatching scene directionality, digital filter overlays resembling Instagram presets, watermark logos embedded visibly anywhere on final image surface, excessive use of glitter effects where none were originally worn during actual shoot session."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 643, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [834.87109375, 485.8143615722656], "pos": [-3595.6787109375, 72.96219635009766], "id": 345, "properties": {"ver": "2986a014694fd27049c3f66d39e3f60904283f9b", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "ComfyUI-Easy-Use.git", "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 27}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [575, 638, 640, 649, 650], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "零化 CONDITIONING", "links": [576, 639, 641, 651, 652], "label": "零化 CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "零化 CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["qwen_3_4b.safetensors", "qwen_image", "default", "photorealistic studio portrait of a young East Asian woman posing confidently in front of a dark velvet backdrop; atmosphere: sensual and glamorous, captured with Canon EOS R5 + EF 85mm f/1.4L IS USM lens at aperture f/1.4, shutter speed 1/250s, ISO 100, focal length 85mm for shallow depth-of-field and creamy bokeh.\n\nHer posture is upright yet alluring, hands gently pulling the fluffy white crop top to a